{"nodes": [{"id": "design_mockups_project_flow_dc_mark_won", "label": "Mark won - a won deal becomes a project", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "design/mockups/Project Flow.dc.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Two fields and one confirmation. Customer, design, accepted proposal and payment schedule all carry over so nothing is re-typed."}, {"id": "design_mockups_project_flow_dc_projects_board", "label": "Projects board by stage", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "design/mockups/Project Flow.dc.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Shows what is moving, what is stuck and where money is owed. Days-in-stage is the metric because a project installed but stuck a month is not 'nearly finished'."}, {"id": "design_mockups_project_flow_dc_project_detail", "label": "Project detail", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "design/mockups/Project Flow.dc.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Everything about one project in one place with the next action obvious. Advancing a stage updates the customer progress link and makes the next payment tranche due."}, {"id": "design_mockups_project_flow_dc_project_payments", "label": "Project payments - collect against tranches", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "design/mockups/Project Flow.dc.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The same tranche split set in the proposal, on the same client-payable total. A tranche becomes due the moment its milestone passes; money owed never blocks the customer's progress link - chase the person, not the view."}, {"id": "design_mockups_project_flow_dc_document_checklist", "label": "Project document checklist", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "design/mockups/Project Flow.dc.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Some documents arrive automatically from earlier stages; the rest are uploaded. The handover pack unlocks only when every document is verified. Subsidy sanction stays visible because it is the customer's money."}, {"id": "design_mockups_project_flow_dc_blockers", "label": "Project blockers", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "design/mockups/Project Flow.dc.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every delay names who is waiting and the date it started, so responsibility stays visible. An explained delay is tolerable; a hidden one becomes a complaint."}, {"id": "design_mockups_project_flow_dc_handover", "label": "Handover and project close", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "design/mockups/Project Flow.dc.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "On completion the project closes and the customer's progress link flips to 'your system is live'. A closed project can be reopened, and the referral ask is placed here because the roof is new."}, {"id": "design_mockups_project_flow_dc_customer_progress_link", "label": "Customer progress link", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "design/mockups/Project Flow.dc.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A public link the customer holds that updates as stages advance and blockers are set. It stays open even when payment is overdue - data is never held hostage."}, {"id": "design_mockups_project_flow_dc_days_in_stage", "label": "Days-in-stage metric", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "design/mockups/Project Flow.dc.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "design_mockups_project_flow_dc_blocker_ownership", "label": "Blocker ownership (DISCOM / customer / material / us)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "design/mockups/Project Flow.dc.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Four possible waiting parties including 'us - our own delay, recorded honestly'. The chosen party writes the honest waiting line onto the customer's progress link."}, {"id": "design_mockups_project_flow_dc_handover_pack", "label": "Handover document pack", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "design/mockups/Project Flow.dc.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "design_mockups_project_flow_dc_project_stages", "label": "Project execution stages", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "design/mockups/Project Flow.dc.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "design_mockups_project_flow_dc_deal_to_project_carryover", "label": "Deal-to-project carry-over", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "design/mockups/Project Flow.dc.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Customer, approved design, accepted proposal and the payment schedule move into the project untouched. Final value is pre-filled from the accepted proposal and editable; the install date is a target, verified on the site visit."}], "edges": [{"source": "design_mockups_project_flow_dc_mark_won", "target": "design_mockups_project_flow_dc_deal_to_project_carryover", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "design/mockups/Project Flow.dc.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_mockups_project_flow_dc_mark_won", "target": "design_mockups_project_flow_dc_p